{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Service Desk**: Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n2. **Brightdesk**: Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n3. **Orbitly**: Works as a lightweight request queue for small teams.\n\nA quick way to decide: Northwind CRM is the strongest fit for most teams; Brightdesk is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f1-721c-bb2d-35b5641b0941","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:55.500Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["best shared inbox support team","shared inbox vs help desk"],"latency_ms":9100,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[102,115],[381,394]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[205,215],[432,442]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[292,299]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a96ebe4716